{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50997","headline":"春日登大悲阁回文（二首） 二 · 钱惟治","name":"春日登大悲阁回文（二首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧天临迥阁，晴雪点山屏。\n夕烟侵冷箔，明月歛闲亭。\n（见《宋诗纪事》卷三引《冰川诗式》。\n）（均见明梁桥《冰川诗式》卷二，前首「危阑」作「危栏」，「华国」作「华阁」。\n）（〖1〗《湖州府志》：「吴越《回文绶带连环诗碑》，在法华寺，节度使钱惟治作，九十首。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱惟治","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}